<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sistem Verifikasi Ijazah Digital - USK</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        uskBlue: '#00428A',
                        uskDarkBlue: '#003366',
                        uskGold: '#fbbf24',
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #0b4084;
            background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, #072a5a 0%, #0b4084 100%);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen font-sans p-2 sm:p-4 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-start items-center gap-4">

    <div class="max-w-4xl w-full px-2">
        <a href="/" class="text-white bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition inline-flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Kembali Isi Form Data
        </a>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl w-full bg-white rounded-2xl md:rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-white/20">
        
        <div class="bg-[#00428A] text-white p-5 sm:p-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center border-b-[6px] border-amber-400 relative">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-center md:text-left mb-4 md:mb-0 w-full md:w-auto justify-center md:justify-start">
                <div class="w-14 h-14 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 bg-amber-400 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-[#00428A] text-xl sm:text-2xl shadow-md shrink-0">
                    USK
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-lg sm:text-xl md:text-2xl font-black tracking-wider leading-tight">UNIVERSITAS SYIAH KUALA</h1>
                    <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs tracking-widest text-amber-300 font-bold">DARUSSALAM, BANDA ACEH</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center md:text-right w-full md:w-auto border-t border-white/10 md:border-none pt-3 md:pt-0">
                <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold tracking-wide text-white">SISTEM VERIFIKASI IJAZAH DIGITAL</h2>
                <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-blue-200">USK - Sistem Verifikasi Ijazah Secara Elektronik</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 sm:p-6 md:p-8 space-y-6">

            <div class="border border-green-200 bg-green-50/60 rounded-xl p-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 sm:gap-6 shadow-sm text-center sm:text-left">
                <div class="w-14 h-14 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 bg-green-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl sm:text-3xl shadow shrink-0">
                    <i class="fas fa-check"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-green-700 tracking-wide mb-1">DOKUMEN ASLI / VERIFIED</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
                        Data ini menyatakan bahwa ijazah dengan nomor tersebut di bawah ini adalah sah dan diterbitkan oleh <span class="font-bold text-gray-900">Universitas Syiah Kuala.</span>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[#00428A] font-bold text-sm sm:text-base border-b border-gray-100">
                    <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-[#00428A] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs">
                        <i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i>
                    </div>
                    <span>DETAIL DATA LULUSAN</span>
                </div>
                
                <div class="w-full">
                    <table class="w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base border-collapse">
                        <tbody>
                            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
                                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-500 font-medium w-5/12 sm:w-1/3">Nama Lengkap</td>
                                <td class="py-3 px-2 font-bold text-gray-900 uppercase"><%= data.mahasiswa.namaLengkap %></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50">
                                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-500 font-medium">Nomor Induk Mahasiswa</td>
                                <td class="py-3 px-2 font-semibold text-gray-800 tracking-wide"><%= data.mahasiswa.nim %></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100">
                                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-500 font-medium">Nomor Ijazah Nasional</td>
                                <td class="py-3 px-2 font-semibold text-gray-800 tracking-wide"><%= data.mahasiswa.nomorIjazahNasional %></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50/50">
                                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-500 font-medium">Program Studi / Jenjang</td>
                                <td class="py-3 px-2 font-semibold text-gray-800"><%= data.mahasiswa.programStudi %></td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-500 font-medium">Tanggal Kelulusan</td>
                                <td class="py-3 px-2 font-semibold text-gray-800"><%= data.mahasiswa.tanggalKelulusan %></td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden bg-white">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[#00428A] font-bold text-sm sm:text-base mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3">
                    <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-[#00428A] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs">
                        <i class="fas fa-file-alt"></i>
                    </div>
                    <span>INFORMASI DOKUMEN</span>
                </div>

                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start gap-4 relative z-10">
                    <div class="w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-3 text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base">
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-1">
                            <span class="col-span-5 sm:col-span-4 text-gray-500 font-medium">Tanggal Terbit</span>
                            <span class="col-span-1 text-center text-gray-400">:</span>
                            <span class="col-span-6 font-semibold text-gray-800"><%= data.dokumen.tanggalTerbit %></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-1">
                            <span class="col-span-5 sm:col-span-4 text-gray-500 font-medium">Perguruan Tinggi</span>
                            <span class="col-span-1 text-center text-gray-400">:</span>
                            <span class="col-span-6 font-semibold text-gray-800"><%= data.dokumen.perguruanTinggi %></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-1">
                            <span class="col-span-5 sm:col-span-4 text-gray-500 font-medium">Fakultas</span>
                            <span class="col-span-1 text-center text-gray-400">:</span>
                            <span class="col-span-6 font-semibold text-gray-800"><%= data.dokumen.fakultas %></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-1">
                            <span class="col-span-5 sm:col-span-4 text-gray-500 font-medium">Jenis Ijazah</span>
                            <span class="col-span-1 text-center text-gray-400">:</span>
                            <span class="col-span-6 font-semibold text-gray-800"><%= data.dokumen.jenisIjazah %></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-1 items-center">
                            <span class="col-span-5 sm:col-span-4 text-gray-500 font-medium">Status Verifikasi</span>
                            <span class="col-span-1 text-center text-gray-400">:</span>
                            <span class="col-span-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1 bg-green-100 text-green-700 font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] sm:text-xs border border-green-300 w-fit">
                                <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> <%= data.dokumen.statusVerifikasi %>
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="absolute md:relative right-2 bottom-0 md:right-0 md:bottom-0 opacity-15 md:opacity-30 flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-24 h-24 sm:w-28 sm:h-28 border-4 border-amber-500 rounded-full font-black text-amber-600 text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-center select-none z-0">
                        UNIVERSITAS<br>USK<br>BANDA ACEH
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-[#00428A] font-bold text-sm sm:text-base border-b border-gray-100">
                    <div class="w-7 h-7 bg-[#00428A] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-xs">
                        <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i>
                    </div>
                    <span>STATUS TANDA TANGAN ELEKTRONIK (TTE)</span>
                </div>

                <div class="p-4 bg-gray-50 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-stretch sm:items-center gap-4">
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 bg-green-700 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-base sm:text-xl shrink-0 shadow">
                            <i class="fas fa-lock"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-left">
                            <h4 class="font-extrabold text-green-700 text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wide">TANDA TANGAN ELEKTRONIK VALID</h4>
                            <p class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">
                                Dokumen ini telah ditandatangani secara elektronik dengan sertifikat yang diterbitkan oleh <span class="font-semibold text-gray-700">BSrE (Badan Siber dan Sandi Negara).</span>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-[#002855] text-white p-2.5 sm:p-3 rounded-lg text-center font-bold text-[10px] sm:text-xs tracking-wider shrink-0 flex flex-col justify-center min-w-[120px]">
                        BSrE
                        <span class="text-[8px] sm:text-[9px] font-normal text-blue-200 block mt-0.5">Tersertifikasi Elektronik</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="bg-[#003366] text-white p-4 text-center text-[10px] sm:text-xs space-y-2 border-t border-blue-900">
            <p class="font-bold tracking-wide text-amber-300 sm:text-white">INOVASI, KOLABORASI, DAN AKUNTABILITAS UNTUK USK MAJU DAN BERDAMPAK</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-blue-200 text-[10px] sm:text-xs">
                <span><i class="fas fa-globe"></i> www.usk.ac.id</span>
                <span><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i> @universitassyiahkuala</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[9px] text-gray-400 pt-1">© 2025 Universitas Syiah Kuala</p>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>

